From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: add Samsung S6E3HAD AMF670ZA01 panel driver

The Galaxy Z Flip3's main display: an S6E3HAD DDI driving the 1080x2640
AMF670ZA01 OLED, in DSI command mode with DSC (two 540x40 slices, 8 bpc,
8 bpp). Stock picks this panel by its ID (DA/DB/DC = 91 10 46, revision D
by ID2); the dtbo's default panel, S6E3FAC AMF670BS01, is a different one.

The initialization, display-on and off sequences, the brightness packet
(ACL, gamma, IRC, VINT, VRR) and FFC are the stock ones from Samsung's
ss_dsi_panel_S6E3HAD_AMF670ZA01_FHD panel device tree, with the edits
Samsung's panel code makes to them. Three stock timings are offered:
fhd120hs (default), fhd60hs and fhd60ns, switched by a full modeset.

The panel's frame rate follows the DSI lane rate, and stock runs the lanes
at 910 Mbps. MSM derives the lane rate from the mode clock, so each mode's
horizontal front porch is stretched until that comes to 910 Mbps at the
stock refresh rate; at the stock porches the panel runs at 114.5 Hz.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
@@ -1015,6 +1015,19 @@ config DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3HA2
 	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
 	select VIDEOMODE_HELPERS
 
+config DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3HAD
+	tristate "Samsung S6E3HAD DSI command mode panel"
+	depends on GPIOLIB
+	depends on OF
+	depends on DRM_MIPI_DSI
+	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
+	select DRM_DISPLAY_HELPER
+	select DRM_DISPLAY_DSC_HELPER
+	help
+	  Say Y or M here if you want to enable support for the Samsung
+	  S6E3HAD DDIC with the AMF670ZA01 panel, the main display of the
+	  Galaxy Z Flip3 (1080x2640, DSC, command mode, 120 Hz).
+
 config DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3HA8
 	tristate "Samsung S6E3HA8 DSI video mode panel"
 	depends on GPIOLIB
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile
@@ -98,6 +98,7 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6D7AA0)
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3FA7) += panel-samsung-s6e3fa7.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3FC2X01) += panel-samsung-s6e3fc2x01.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3HA2) += panel-samsung-s6e3ha2.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3HAD) += panel-samsung-s6e3had.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E3HA8) += panel-samsung-s6e3ha8.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E63J0X03) += panel-samsung-s6e63j0x03.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_PANEL_SAMSUNG_S6E63M0) += panel-samsung-s6e63m0.o
